{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011Cfph3yQJeEcS3uHawQby7","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Credit Limit Increase Decision: CR-9201 (Acme Mfg. Holdings)\n\n## Analysis\n\n### 1. The Request\n- **ID:** CR-9201\n- **Customer:** Acme Mfg. Holdings (ERP C-1001, CRM account CRM-2048, \"Acme Manufacturing\")\n- **Current limit:** $250,000\n- **Requested limit:** $400,000\n- **Request date:** 2026-09-23\n- **Requestor:** Sarah Chen, Enterprise Account Executive\n- **Basis:** Standard (customer's own standing as a Strategic account). The parent guarantee mentioned in Sarah's email to Priya is noted as future headroom, not required for this request.\n\n### 2. Customer Identity Confirmation\nVerified across systems:\n- **CRM:** CRM-2048 (Strategic, Midwest Enterprise)\n- **ERP:** C-1001 (Acme Mfg. Holdings)\n- **Legal agreement:** Master Supply Agreement ACME-MFG-2025 with Acme Mfg. Holdings\n- **Support agreement:** Schedule C to ACME-MFG-2025, covering Acme Mfg. Holdings only\n\n### 3. Policy in Effect\n**Northstar Credit Policy 2026** (effective 2026-01-01 through 2026-12-31)\n\n### 4. Payment History\nReview period: 12 months before 2026-09-23 = 2025-09-23 to 2026-09-23\n\nInvoices for C-1001 in this period:\n- **INV-60412** (2025-10-14): Due 2025-11-28, paid 2025-11-24 → **4 days early** ✓\n- **INV-62011** (2026-06-10): Due 2026-07-25, paid 2026-07-22 → **3 days early** ✓\n- **INV-62305** (2026-08-18): Due 2026-10-02 → **not yet due at request date** ✓\n\n**Payment history status:** ELIGIBLE. No invoices paid more than 30 days after due date, or unpaid more than 30 days past due.\n\n### 5. Maximum Limit\n- **Account tier:** Strategic (per CRM-2048)\n- **Credit Policy 2026, section 5:** Strategic accounts have a base maximum of **$750,000**\n- **Parent guarantee in effect:** GRT-ACME-2026\n  - Guarantor: Acme Group Holdings, Inc.\n  - Guaranteed party: Acme Mfg. Holdings (this customer)\n  - Amount: **$400,000**\n  - Term: 2026-01-01 to 2027-12-31 (**active on request date**)\n- **Combined maximum:** $750,000 + $400,000 = **$1,150,000**\n- **Requested limit:** $400,000\n- **Comparison:** $400,000 ≤ $1,150,000 ✓\n\n**Eligibility:** ELIGIBLE\n\n### 6. Requestor's Approval Authority\n- **Requestor role:** Enterprise Account Executive (Sarah Chen)\n- **Policy grant of authority:** Credit Policy 2026 section 3 grants authority only to:\n  - Accounts Receivable Specialists (≤$100,000)\n  - Finance Manager (>$100,000 and ≤$500,000)\n  - Director of Finance (>$500,000)\n- **Sarah Chen's authority:** **None.** She may submit the request but may not approve it.\n\n### 7. Required Approvers\n- **Requested limit:** $400,000 (new total)\n- **Policy rule:** Credit Policy 2026, section 3: Limits >$100,000 and ≤$500,000 require **Finance Manager** approval\n- **Concurrence:** Policy section 4 requires VP Sales concurrence for Strategic accounts only when limit >$500,000. Not applicable here.\n- **Finance Manager:** Priya Shah (from ORG-CHART-2026-09 and employees.csv)\n- **Separation of duties:** Sarah Chen (requestor) ≠ Priya Shah (approver) ✓\n\n### 8. Decision\nThe customer is **eligible** for $400,000. The requestor (Sarah Chen, Enterprise Account Executive) has **no approval authority** under the policy. The approval falls to **Priya Shah (Finance Manager)**, who has the required authority for this limit amount.\n\n**Outcome:** `APPROVE_WITH_AUTHORIZATION`\n\n---\n\n```json\n{\n  \"outcome\": \"APPROVE_WITH_AUTHORIZATION\",\n  \"request\": {\n    \"id\": \"CR-9201\",\n    \"customer\": \"Acme Mfg. Holdings (C-1001)\",\n    \"current_limit\": 250000,\n    \"requested_limit\": 400000,\n    \"date\": \"2026-09-23\",\n    \"requestor\": \"Sarah Chen (Enterprise Account Executive)\",\n    \"basis\": \"standard\"\n  },\n  \"eligibility\": {\n    \"status\": \"eligible\",\n    \"maximum_limit\": 1150000,\n    \"basis\": \"Strategic account base maximum $750,000 (Credit Policy 2026, section 5) plus parent guarantee GRT-ACME-2026 of $400,000 in force through 2027-12-31. Requested limit $400,000 is within maximum.\",\n    \"late_invoices\": []\n  },\n  \"authority\": {\n    \"policy\": \"Northstar Credit Policy 2026\",\n    \"requestor_limit\": null,\n    \"requestor_authorized\": false,\n    \"required_role\": \"Finance Manager\",\n    \"approvers\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Priya Shah\",\n        \"role\": \"Finance Manager\",\n        \"kind\": \"approval\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  \"evidence\": [\n    \"Credit Policy 2026, section 3: Finance Manager approval required for limits >$100,000 and ≤$500,000\",\n    \"CRM-2048: Account tier Strategic\",\n    \"Payment history (12 months prior to 2026-09-23): INV-60412 paid early (2025-11-24 vs. due 2025-11-28); INV-62011 paid early (2026-07-22 vs. due 2026-07-25); INV-62305 not yet due at request date (due 2026-10-02)\",\n    \"Parent Company Guarantee GRT-ACME-2026: $400,000, effective 2026-01-01 to 2027-12-31, guarantees Acme Mfg. Holdings\",\n    \"Organization Chart (ORG-CHART-2026-09): Priya Shah is Finance Manager\"\n  ],\n  \"missing_evidence\": [],\n  \"conditions\": []\n}\n```"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":9,"cache_creation_input_tokens":25169,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":25169},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a123901a-860d-45ba-a80c-8ded928e30d4","uuid":"9290a001-3a34-4ada-afc3-574f7b31445f","timestamp":"2026-10-08T11:29:28.142Z","request_id":"req_011Cfph3yARCX4oNSqTGzoAT"}
